     4952           ACCUM TOTAL sj-adv.brutto-sum @ sj-adv.brutto-sum
     4953           ACCUM TOTAL sj-adv.discnt-sum @ sj-adv.discnt-sum
     4954           (IF (ACCUM TOTAL sj-adv.qnty) <> 0 THEN
     4955           round( ( ACCUM TOTAL sj-adv.discnt-sum ) /
     4956                       ( ACCUM TOTAL sj-adv.brutto-sum ) * 100 , 1 ) ELSE 0) @ pcnt
     4957           ACCUM TOTAL sj-adv.netto-sum @ sj-adv.netto-sum
     4958               with FRAME sj-base-d .
