     6469         ACCUM SUB-TOTAL BY  sj-adv.discnt  sj-adv.netto-sum-r @ sj-adv.netto-sum-r
     6470         with FRAME sj-full-d .
     6471         DOWN STREAM PrnLibStream 1 with FRAME sj-full-d .
     6472        end.
